Hosts clash with blades against trees as blood becomes a river --- Narāntaka Kumbhahanu Mahānāda and Samunnata slaughter monkeys --- Dvivida Durmukha Jāmbavān and Tāra slay all four ministers --- Prahasta routs monkeys with arrow floods --- Nīla meets Prahasta and kills his swift horses with a sāla tree --- Dismounted pair trade mace strokes for tree blows --- Nīla crushes Prahasta skull with a rock --- Demons flee to Laṅkā and Nīla meets Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa victorious